{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56927","headline":"广顺末京师谶 · 佚名","name":"广顺末京师谶","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"小儿剃元首。\n（《说郛》卷二十引秦再思《洛中记异录》）（按：《洛中记异录》言此爲「新君之兆也。\n未几世宗嗣位，即替元首也。\n」《类说》卷十二引《纪异录》作「识者曰」，「元首」作「光首」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"佚名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56927.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56927","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}